{"id":"03eb55c90bb8f9b8","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree.md","title":"ZFC Tree9 Initial Subtree","display":"df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree — ZFC Tree9 Initial Subtree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree — ZFC Tree9 Initial Subtree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree — ZFC Tree9 Initial Subtree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T,\\leq_T\\in V\">\\(S,T,\\leq_T\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq T\">\\(S\\subseteq T\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\\subseteq T\\times T\">\\(\\leq_T\\subseteq T\\times T\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9InitialSubtree}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9InitialSubtree}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}initial\\text{-}subtree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9InitialSubtree}_S(S,T,\\leq_T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Tree}(T,\\leq_T)\\land S\\subseteq T\n\\land\\forall s\\in S\\;\\forall t\\in T\\;(\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\to t\\in S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}initial\\text{-}subtree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9InitialSubtree}_S(S,T,\\leq_T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Tree}(T,\\leq_T)\\land S\\subseteq T\n\\land\\forall s\\in S\\;\\forall t\\in T\\;(\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\to t\\in S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Downward closure in the ambient tree order makes the induced order on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> a tree order automatically.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tree}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,T,\\leq_T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T\\subseteq T\\times T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tree}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9InitialSubtree}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}initial\\text{-}subtree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9InitialSubtree}_S(S,T,\\leq_T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Tree}(T,\\leq_T)\\land S\\subseteq T\n\\land\\forall s\\in S\\;\\forall t\\in T\\;(\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\to t\\in S).","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":987,"backlinks":[{"id":"30b79de3589c9f1e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree9InitialSubtree}_S$（初始子树谓词，见 [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3834","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree.md|58-df-zfc-tree9-initial-subtree]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f06e57c5c0b1354d"]}